# 0225 = 0224 + full CDC-ACM 75B (IAD + CDC function descriptors).
#   Default rubyusbcmd=1 path: Config 75B = 9+8(IAD)+9+19(CDC)+7+9+7+7.
#   EP0 CDC class: SET_LINE_CODING/SET_CONTROL_LINE_STATE ACK, GET_LINE_CODING 115200 8N1.
#   EP3 (0x83) TX3 CSR NAK-enable (no QMU, no XactErr polling storm).
#   Vendor mode unchanged.
